  "solution": {
    "brief": "1b. Connections from Vertex\r\nWhen creating a connection from a part vertex, it is not possible\r\nto calculate directly its orientation. Hence it is necessary to define\r\nits orientation plane in Grasshopper, and then create a connection\r\nwith the \"ConnectionFromPlane\" component.\r\nConventionally, planes have the Z axis directed outside of the part.",
